{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3cf1e141ec1a403f61657bed930f8333e9d536e43ba351073115a5c44784ed4c", "ja": "（今日のオーディションは、次の子で最後だ。\n39プロジェクトのアイドル候補は、現れるかな……）", "zh": "（今天的甄选，下一位就是最后一个人了。\n究竟39PROJECT的偶像候补会不会出现呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "722d67ec526d8dcbf9dd8842ff298c1d6bc04e0e37c990f45a3acd527752f740", "ja": "はじめまして、佐竹美奈子といいます。\nよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "初次见面，我叫佐竹美奈子。\n请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5a3b27a6760cc42c97417372b6bb7b65b88c9045b99b8daad9d109601a5a5b02", "ja": "佐竹美奈子さんだね。\nこちらこそ、よろしく。", "zh": "佐竹美奈子小姐是吗？\n彼此彼此，请多指教。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_1003_p", "source_sha256": "2fa6d2e6cda988bcc7cfb4a3d3f2ee896d6fde64cd7f67508341d9bb7bde16fa", "ja": "それじゃ、単刀直入に聞くけど……君は、\nどうしてアイドルになろうと思ったのかな？", "zh": "那么我就直接问了……\n你为什么想当偶像呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "5d75b9ae3e223b0d50c23e63a0df2af962de241a429dc6a2a8c10937e2f91b2d", "ja": "う～ん、そうですね。\n元々アイドルが好きっていうのもあるんですけど……。", "zh": "嗯～这个嘛，\n虽然原本我就喜欢偶像也是原因之一……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "6c936396594a145a014371849fff60f15beae7270df10e4516b0fda879b640ac", "ja": "1番の理由は、友達に誘われたからです！\n私達3人組なんですけど、すっごく仲がいいんですよ♪", "zh": "但最大的原因，是朋友找我一起报名！\n我们是三人组，感情非常好喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0ee97405619d0d9a74fa5a35991b5a9a492773b884a1ccd51773e389d97fc1b0", "ja": "へえ、そうなんだ。\n今日は、その友達と一緒に来てるの？", "zh": "哦，这样啊。\n今天你是和那些朋友一起来的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "6e7bd50867c38a1b43247581056377bcbc46667f313bbe181cf4d0c49f720002", "ja": "はいっ！　私も友達も合格して、一緒のグループで\nアイドル活動ができたらな～……なんて！", "zh": "是啊！如果自己跟朋友都顺利录取，\n能在同一团一起当偶像就好了～就是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "d6fc3203e0e144a2859f6b848f077e7f56fe43afa1ef61510bd044170b8176ef", "ja": "夢みたいな話ですけど、そんな風にできたら\nいいな～って思うんです。えへへっ♪", "zh": "虽然听起来像是白日梦，但要是能成真就好了～\n我是这么想的。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_1009_p", "source_sha256": "afba27e51bff45e9060ff4e5cccacb28d72e990622229d8064927fdbfe076c96", "ja": "確かに、夢のある話だね。\nでも……。", "zh": "确实是充满梦想的想像呢。\n不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a2686fc8fa1202ea3b21a2ce72399c7ef0d40c6cc3b71d1faa3312c0638920f0", "ja": "もしも君だけが落ちたり、逆に友達だけが落ちたり。\nあるいは、ソロでライバルになった時は、どうする？", "zh": "如果只有你落选，或反过来只有朋友落选，\n又或者你们个人出道成为对手时，你要怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "5867b35d0f11ddf5a2a45651e0683b62483039bd1bb37a6ababcbf2121d26ff4", "ja": "それは……。", "zh": "那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "6d60aaa5aaba2fa657bda47ac9ac1ff7ed9dff0ac4bd50250254ca9736be03c5", "ja": "……それは、すぐには答えを出せません。\nすごく、悩んじゃうと思います。", "zh": "……我没办法马上回答。\n我想自己应该会非常烦恼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "a827f0735c84eb5fbba332d17a3ba015cbce1f7d7e7f90c0d835e8cef347730e", "ja": "……でも！　悩んで、一生懸命考えて……\n私なりに、答えを出したいと思います！", "zh": "……不过！我应该会拚命烦恼、拚命思考……\n并找出自己的答案！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "93955b1d888597acc67f16d42b8a2a7e27e8522bff25326a0aa7bbee51b9403e", "ja": "だって、みんなの「アイドルになりたい」って気持ちは\n本気だって思うから。私も、本気で考えます。", "zh": "毕竟大家「想成为偶像」的心意都很认真，\n所以我也要认真思考。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_1016_p", "source_sha256": "10467659d2ecef4639e2c31cf0ab84afa02233d9fc59b85fd566372afaa8088a", "ja": "そうか。ありがとう。\n難しい質問をして悪かったね。", "zh": "这样啊，谢谢你。\n抱歉问了这么刁钻的问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "7194d34ea5b79a03188a34b9279c5b220381544cac86bbe8db0a9a61d273ca50", "ja": "いえ、そんなことないです！\nだって、本当のことだと思いますし……。", "zh": "不，不会啦！\n因为我是真心这么想的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "16bdae6e0081f8e324186225515b6cc1e156bd44da7ec1e128b348b9f3e5209d", "ja": "でも、気を遣ってくれてありがとうございます！\nプロデューサーさんて、優しいんですね！　えへへっ♪", "zh": "不过，谢谢你替我担心！\n制作人先生，你真是温柔呢！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_1019_p", "source_sha256": "c160de64b9257bb43577a806c1ec143bdc1ea165541c75ccd7206c6c63cfe950", "ja": "（「ひとりでもアイドルになる」と答える子が多い中、\n彼女は「ちゃんと考えてから答えを出す」と言った）", "zh": "（许多人都会回答「就算只有我一个人也要当偶像」，\n而她却说「我要好好思考过再找出答案」）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_1020_p", "source_sha256": "a7a9583d8e30b698c744a77f43bd0e60a2086918b1dfed2a1ac9f816bbc1a6c3", "ja": "（優しい子みたいだし、自分だけ合格したら、きっと\n迷うんだろうな。甘いと言う人もいるだろうけど……）", "zh": "（她应该是个体贴的孩子，要是只有自己被录取，\n一定会很迷惘吧。或许也有人会说这样很天真……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_1021_019min", "source_sha256": "0183604e9afca9322135e9def96b0860eba064bfd12c21f510d23095825fd217", "ja": "アイドルって、キラキラしてて素敵ですよね！\nレッスンとか、きっと大変なんでしょうけど……。", "zh": "偶像闪闪发光的，很耀眼动人对吧！\n虽然我想训练方面一定很辛苦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_1022_019min", "source_sha256": "93db4d843886891a8de9811ac34c681fb580c5ad5ab5c1929722064788c42f59", "ja": "でも、見てると元気をもらえるんです！　私もそんな\n風に、誰かを元気にできたら……って思います！", "zh": "可是看着偶像，我就能获得活力！\n我也想像那样……把活力带给其他人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_1023_p", "source_sha256": "692fb882c4a7ba901a306be08c5148a43e62edbee45263d361accc0e2c0ba73f", "ja": "（キラキラと輝いて、誰かを元気に、か……）", "zh": "（闪闪发光，并把活力带给其他人吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_1024", "source_sha256": "7f8354a6527db909d196ec480e15d6a619dba6369e42758706f5d9526ae4c968", "ja": "合格！", "zh": "录取！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "727e676929e75fa6989397feffacef363f324f67a1ffc3f84a30bbb2c5ac6182", "ja": "合格だ、佐竹美奈子さん。\n39プロジェクトのアイドルとして、君を迎えたい！", "zh": "佐竹美奈子小姐，你被录取了！\n我想让你成为39PROJECT的偶像之一！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2001_019min", "source_sha256": "30349b2f3e432ca7057cacad427b9e188462042af8ca1ae5829175045fe10adc", "ja": "ご、合格ですか？\nや、やった、やりました！　わっほ～い！！", "zh": "我、我被绿取了吗？\n太、太好了，太棒了！哇哦～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2002_p", "source_sha256": "a833b13d25e4d71cec0a1b973a863c44f360b4444ed41b477cb9a07af31a879e", "ja": "けど、今日のオーディションで合格したのは君ひとり\nなんだ。……それを聞いても、頑張っていけるかな？", "zh": "不过在今天的甄选中，录取的只有你一个人……\n你听到这个消息，也能继续努力下去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2003_019min", "source_sha256": "8f1b6c7d25216d846252d095271cd031297515ef9908a086c6b78f77e29e80f2", "ja": "えっ！？\nじゃあ、私の友達は……。", "zh": "咦！？\n那么，我的朋友……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2004_p", "source_sha256": "242b734371e92e3db22181c719f2aab72801b257617dac6996b9e0c5f05aa990", "ja": "残念だけど……。", "zh": "很遗憾……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2005_019min", "source_sha256": "7c450fad02c1f9f88fb607c73206a7c86fa975b8be1aae81cd07cb6b832ecfac", "ja": "…………。\nそう、ですか……。", "zh": "…………\n这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2006_p", "source_sha256": "12c2b453c92e49c6bb219316cd035f25edc1865515b19e3ea25d1495eee230ef", "ja": "急がなくていいから、答えを聞かせてほしい。\n気持ちの整理も必要だと思うし。", "zh": "你不用急，找机会告诉我答案吧。\n我想你也需要整理一下情绪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2007_019min", "source_sha256": "a2c8df994dfab829f5203ad6554197f2c3623c524657767cd5575f02b0fee477", "ja": "はい……。", "zh": "好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2008_019min", "source_sha256": "20333bc5b43f02c3cf9822778dae469c1d7ca6053606e237b4044571b8238273", "ja": "あっ……ご、ごめんなさい。嬉しいんですけど、\n素直に喜んでいいのか、わからなくって……。", "zh": "啊……对、对不起。虽然我很高兴，\n但不知道该不该直接表现出喜悦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2009_019min", "source_sha256": "57b6a1a9447590e355d7b155398d4a877e7db5894a24a3d2200425eede40838b", "ja": "暗い顔しちゃって、本当にごめんなさい！\nあの、考える時間、もらってもいいですか？", "zh": "很抱歉摆出这么阴沉的表情！\n请问，可以给我一些时间思考吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2010_p", "source_sha256": "54b0f7d12a1b7a4bf2cdbfde7c3488e1672d3c897199c3806def82d8d60102a9", "ja": "もちろん。\n君なりの答えを聞かせてくれるのを、待ってるよ。", "zh": "那当然，\n我等着听属于你的答案。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2011_019min", "source_sha256": "d4556da9c72be55a6e628e68bc7e2390382ea34e263e43cd94d3594f6ec2ebcb", "ja": "……はいっ！", "zh": "……好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2012_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2013_019min", "source_sha256": "b0587538be400c7a5792ebecc8c718982c0efdac51cb27960ec5115124b669d4", "ja": "すみません！　失礼しま～す！", "zh": "不好意思！打扰了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2014_p", "source_sha256": "323cfdb72e5706e00a4af9fedc9f5263246d251e4e79274c7f1defe4b933e742", "ja": "は～い……\nあっ、君は……！", "zh": "请进～\n啊，你是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2015_019min", "source_sha256": "0032786e260eb4704aaa69f8de083602332eb9af3311157597d177c0bfb53071", "ja": "こんにちは！\n答え、決まりました！", "zh": "你好！\n我想好答案了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2016_p", "source_sha256": "4dbf6c74b9c577c81f6f979af369351eff09a607cef620b4ef47f9ebe0c1b4ae", "ja": "そうか。\nそれじゃ、さっそく聞かせてもらえるかな。", "zh": "是吗。\n那就马上告诉我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2017_019min", "source_sha256": "ff127f1ed00154109040b35c3e16ff058b9c1bc419ad14c38c5d307ee483b7db", "ja": "はい！　……あの後、オーディションに合格したこと、\n誰にも話せなくて……ずっと、ひとりで考えてました。", "zh": "是……在那之后，我无法告诉任何人\n自己在甄选中录取的事……一直独自思考着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2018_019min", "source_sha256": "8815d73d00faf9c28e1c61eeb4f05f36710494b560271d87f41ca9dfcd473ce3", "ja": "そしたら、「何か隠してるでしょ」って\n言われちゃって。私、ウソが下手みたいです。", "zh": "然后就被朋友问说「你有事瞒着我们吧」，\n看来我不擅长说谎。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2019_p", "source_sha256": "55a16534f4d61e56b523ffdf0396f65fb3b896cd64cb392e08f8e9c67da5a0ad", "ja": "そう。……友達は、なんて？", "zh": "这样啊……你朋友怎么说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2020_019min", "source_sha256": "f081ab43921b94823e7a3478c149c4503d3c024913fe4bf14eefde81a58c9e65", "ja": "「そんな大事なことを隠してるなんて！」って、\n怒られちゃいました。それから……", "zh": "她们说「你居然瞒着我们这么重要的事！」\n然后被骂了一顿，之后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2021_019min", "source_sha256": "be4187e6f29d83967eec09c584df54e94b31304b846370e8c984a4b4aa8266a0", "ja": "応援するって、言ってくれました。大事な友達だから、\nその友達の夢だから、絶対に応援する、って……。", "zh": "她们说支持我，还说我是重要的朋友，\n既然是重要朋友的梦想，她们就绝对会支持……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2022_019min", "source_sha256": "91456610ca1ee197dd0a461ca6c1494e5caa9aca133d357555d0780f861d2b90", "ja": "それを聞いて、私、迷ってなんかいられない！\n……って思ったんです。頑張らなくちゃ、って！", "zh": "听到这番话，我就觉得……\n自己不能继续迷惘下去！我要努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2023_p", "source_sha256": "9cf204e2ab9f46ce0abf19696f38151825b39542da631c5ce278d26361506b24", "ja": "そうだな。\nいい友達を持ったね、佐竹さん。", "zh": "是啊。\n你有一群好朋友呢，佐竹小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2024_019min", "source_sha256": "25b47e74ce5c801de60706019b4efd3e2c85e789607933d0500e588340986373", "ja": "はいっ！\n自慢の友達なんですよ！　えへへ…♪", "zh": "对啊！\n她们可是我引以为傲的好朋友喔！嘿嘿…♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2025_019min", "source_sha256": "578b6d8ab467aee8b9ab2c543904dfa044227fe0e0bb253f7558af68e24935fe", "ja": "遅くなりましたけど、私、覚悟を決めました！\nプロデューサーさん、私を、アイドルにしてください！", "zh": "虽然现在说有点晚，但我下定决心了！\n制作人先生，请你让我当上偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2026_p", "source_sha256": "63d82e6cfa12c0bdbb0036496956f8a4a67f9a2ed917c2117dfbe123423b5316", "ja": "ああ、わかった！\nこちらこそ、よろしくな！", "zh": "嗯，我知道了！\n也请你多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2027_019min", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_001_2028_p", "source_sha256": "4c897959bf5a2e3bf3abcbbdf37a48a3445dc6b3fd620ebecbb4797498a315d1", "ja": "（目が少し赤い気が……大変な決意だったんだろう。\n彼女の覚悟は、必ず芽吹くはずだ……！）", "zh": "（看她眼睛红红的……这一定是历经挣扎才下的决定吧。\n她的决心一定会开花结果的……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
